# Interactive Temperature Converter

A lightweight web application that converts temperatures between Celsius, Fahrenheit, and Kelvin in real time with input validation.

## Features
- **Multi-Unit Support:** Convert dynamically between Celsius, Fahrenheit, and Kelvin.
- **Input Validation:** Prevents non-numeric input and shows error alerts.
- **Edge Case Protection:** Alerts users if a value falls below Absolute Zero ($-273.15^\circ\text{C}$).
- **Clean Interface:** Centered, user-friendly UI designed for clarity.

## Formulas Used
- **Celsius to Fahrenheit:** $(^\circ\text{C} \times 9/5) + 32$
- **Fahrenheit to Celsius:** $(^\circ\text{F} - 32) \times 5/9$
- **Celsius to Kelvin:** $^\circ\text{C} + 273.15$

## Tech Stack
- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript
